Problem Statement: Given a sorted array of N integers, write a program to find the index of the last occurence of the target key. If target is not found then return -1.(Consider 0 based indexing).
Example:
Input: Target =13, array[]={3,4,13,13,13,20,40}
Output: 4.
Explaination: The target value 13 appears for the first time at index number 2  in the array and last time at 4th index of the array